<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Show Text正常活动位置数组有限共享请求</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101a29;color:#e7edf7;font:16px/1.8 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#9fd5ff}nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#172638;padding:12px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}pre{overflow:auto;background:#09131f;padding:16px}code{font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace}table{border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow:auto}td,th{border:1px solid #45617e;padding:8px 12px}blockquote{border-left:4px solid #e7b667;margin:18px 0;padding:1px 16px;background:#203249}h1,h2,h3,h4{scroll-margin-top:85px}img{max-width:100%}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#a9bfd3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer}</style><nav><a href="../../../framework-architecture.html">主架构</a><a href="../../main-ui-map.html">逆向核心</a><a href="../index.html">关联文档目录</a><a data-source-download download href="../../../plugins/N-POINT-DISPLAY-POSITION-ARRAY-REQUEST.md">下载原始文件</a></nav><main><h1 id="show-text正常活动位置数组有限共享请求">Show Text正常活动位置数组有限共享请求</h1><p>2026-10-19。N点整工具自审发现跨工具共享缺口；只写analysis候选与N点专属tests，产品src未改/未构建。根线apply所有共享变更。旧文档scalar-only是当时独立安全支持域，不是原厂禁止数组的事实。</p>
<p>原GetFrontAndSelfFilterTreeOperation.Operate调用GetFrontFilterTree(predicate=true,Output,ExtraParams,IncludeSelf:true,IncludeInside:true,NeedNull:false,IsGlobal:false)；VmModuleExtern.GetOutputTreeNode:1120只type/CanSubscribe/Visible/timestamp，无IsArray/Count禁限；SetResultIOToModuleOperation:262直接RelateIO/RelateIndex并让ShowText Feature.SetMapping(dynamicIO)。普通树可选self.OutImagePointX、WorldPointY数组，属于实际活动UI域。</p>
<p>必须保留数量覆盖分支：Object.GetValueList:620先取first-nonfixed count，但FillValueList:566-587对type==text覆盖为Content值数量（callback ValueStore[Content].Length；direct Feature.GetValueCount）。SetShapeProperty:666/667按最终shape index读PositionX/Y；GetValueByType:1025非空短array越界回首项，空/转换异常默认0。不能据PositionX数组数量多画text。当前正常默认ShowText Content都映射scalar输出，因此单shape index0读取All位置数组；本候选只补这个有证范围。</p>
<p>原资源/当前输出核对：N点ModuStatus/CalibStatus/CalibErrStatus/CalibCurIndex/CalibTotalNum均scalar；N图像CalibStatus/四error/两center/CurNum/TotalNum均scalar；板EstimationError/PixelPrecision；相机映射CalibStatus/ScaleX/ScaleY；畸变ModuStatus/EstimationError；映射六标定/scale/count/error诸字段均scalar。上述6原Display.xml列表写入manifest。另三个现生产定义：TranslationPlugin的ModuStatus/CalibStatus/TransWorldError/RotWorldError/CalibCurIndex/CalibTotalNum，RotateCalibrationPlugin的状态/中心/error/remainCount，ReadCalibFilePlugin的ModuStatus均scalar（Read默认TextVisible=false）。第10“坐标系”尚无相同生产ShowText provider，不伪造其闭合结论；当前可检查9个生产定义未发现默认Content数组。若用户把Content引用改成数组，多text仍需独立Feature解析/实例数量实施，不能本次首项适配称全域完成。</p>
<p>candidate.diff仅修改两块：Native允许NumberArray以及Number/Integer的Array cardinality输出；ApplyPositions接受legacy Numbers、typed NumberArray、typed IntegerArray并取首项，空/缺失/不匹配仍diagnostic+0。StoredBinding维持procedure/node/port/nativeType原source身份和All语义，不增加算法edges。Scalar/constant/只读/删除/跨流程保护保持；Global、insideGroup、WorkflowInputs、动态index不扩。</p>
<p>专属DisplayArrayChecks准备同时枚举scalar/legacyfloatarray/typedfloatarray/intarray，绑定后JSON sourceidentity读回，首项/空/missing/不加算法边界，并保留旧保护。实际NPointCalibration.HostChecks准备真实MainWindow手动9+3既有fixture、point-table弹窗写入、path+RotAxisPoint真实Presenter、record/list、closeDispose、self.OutImagePointX/WorldPointY数组位置绑定、整方案save/load再run及clear失败恢复。未构建，不提前写通过。</p>
<p>根线apply候选后请同步旧tests/VisionConfiguration.DisplaySubscriptionChecks三个历史断言：leaves4→8（原descriptor四numeric×2来源），A/Batch从拒绝改成Available；不要保留与新原证冲突的旧测试。此请求不改共享NPointSolver或数值fixture。</p>
<p class="meta">来源：docs/plugins/N-POINT-DISPLAY-POSITION-ARRAY-REQUEST.md · SHA256 983d7e15cab4424969f6fb33c5006f9359d130d1d4100104af28afa5aa5b28be<br>本页只转换阅读格式，结论与历史进度保留原文。</p></main></html>